      "summary": "The single HTTP transport for the whole SPA: resolves the API base URL from `VITE_API_URL`, performs every JSON fetch, and normalizes non-2xx responses into a typed `ApiError` carrying status, machine-readable code, and a frozen body. Every other module in this batch depends on it and no feature code calls `fetch` directly.",
